        <mxCell id="s1_obj_box" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Lab objectives (Sequential)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[✓] Step #1: Navigate into confidential folder (cd /var/secret)&lt;br/&gt;[✓] Step #2: Change script permission to executable (chmod 755 audit.sh)&lt;br/&gt;[ ] Step #3: Read and verify audit script contents (cat audit.sh)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div align='right'&gt;&lt;i&gt;💡 Hint: Type cat audit.sh&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1f2124;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="190" y="155" width="730" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s1_term_box" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;[o o o]  student@hackacad: ~ (bash simulation)          [ SANDBOX ]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;HackAcad Security Linux Terminal v2.0&lt;br/&gt;student@hackacad:~$ &lt;b&gt;cd /var/secret&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;student@hackacad:/var/secret$ &lt;b&gt;chmod 755 audit.sh&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#007700'&gt;[✓ Step #2 Completed]: chmod 755 audit.sh&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;student@hackacad:/var/secret$ &lt;b&gt;cat audit.sh&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;#!/bin/bash&lt;br/&gt;# Token: FLAG{l1nux_sh3ll_m4st3ry}&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#007700'&gt;[✓ Step #3 Completed]: ALL OBJECTIVES SATISFIED!&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;student@hackacad:/var/secret$ █" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1f2124;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1">
