        <mxCell id="s4_s1" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Lab Details &amp;amp; Metadata&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Lab Title: [ Linux Privilege Escalation &amp;amp; File Audit ]    Difficulty: [ Beginner ▼ ]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1f2124;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1130" y="825" width="750" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4_s2" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Virtual Linux Filesystem Hierarchy&lt;/b&gt;  [+ Folder] [+ File]&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tree View:&lt;/b&gt;                                            &lt;b&gt;Inspector: /home/student/main.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;/ (virtual root)                                    print('Hello, World! Audit verified.')&lt;br/&gt;├── home/student/ [main.py, notes.txt]              # Target script for student execution&lt;br/&gt;├── var/secret/ [audit.sh]&lt;br/&gt;└── etc/passwd" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1f2124;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1130" y="890" width="750" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4_s3" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Allowed Shell Commands&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[x] pwd  [x] cd  [x] ls  [x] cat  [x] touch  [x] nano  [x] grep  [x] chmod  [x] whoami  [x] echo  [x] id  [x] date  [x] history&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(help and clear are always enabled by default; obsolete commands ping/nmap/curl/base64 removed)&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1f2124;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1130" y="1000" width="750" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4_s4" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Exact-Match Custom Commands &amp;amp; Prerequisites&lt;/b&gt;  [+ Add Custom Command]&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Custom Command #1:&lt;/b&gt; Exact string: [ python main.py ]  Enabled: [x] [▲ Move] [✖ Delete]&lt;br/&gt;Predefined Output: [ Hello, World! Audit sandbox verification successful. ]&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;▼ Advanced Options (Configured) - Collapsible&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Required Files &amp;amp; Directories:&lt;/b&gt; [ main.py ] (Must exist in active CWD for command to succeed)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Teacher Description:&lt;/b&gt; Execute python script | &lt;b&gt;Student Hint:&lt;/b&gt; Run python main.py" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1f2124;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;strokeColor=#15803d;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1130" y="1065" width="750" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4_s5" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Lab Objectives (Step-by-Step Evaluation)&lt;/b&gt;  [x] Enforce Sequential Order  [+ Add Objective]&lt;br/&gt;Step 1: Expected: [ cd /var/secret ] | Required Dir: [ / ] | Hint: Navigate to secret folder&lt;br/&gt;Step 2: Expected: [ chmod 755 audit.sh ] | Required Dir: [ /var/secret ] | Hint: Set file executable" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1f2124;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1">
